{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117592","id":3416705678,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7LpsqO","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117592","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117592.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117592.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117592","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117592/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117592/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117592/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ca591812473707227afccad148a826195d14b93f","number":117592,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Add warning for shadowing global constants","user":{"login":"acs110113","id":213753974,"node_id":"U_kgDODL2gdg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213753974?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acs110113","html_url":"https://github.com/acs110113","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acs110113/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acs110113/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acs110113/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acs110113/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acs110113/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acs110113/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acs110113/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acs110113/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acs110113/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Description\r\nThis PR adds a missing warning in GDScript when a local variable or property shadows a global constant (such as `PI`, `OK`, or `INF`). \r\n\r\nPreviously, shadowing these global constants would happen silently, which could lead to confusing logic errors for users who expect to be using the built-in global values.\r\n\r\n### Fixes\r\n\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n- In `gdscript_analyzer.cpp`, added a check against `GDScriptLanguage::get_singleton()->get_global_map()` within the `is_shadowing` validation logic.\r\n- Trigger a `SHADOWED_VARIABLE` warning if a match is found in the global scope.\r\n\r\n### Validation\r\nTested with the following script:\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar PI = 3.14 # Now triggers a warning\r\nvar OK = 0    # Now triggers a warning\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-03-18T20:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-03-18T20:09:43Z","closed_at":"2026-03-18T20:08:58Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e78bae3ce753cc8dbff41685f081e94fb5fb27ab","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"acs110113:fix-global-shadowing-warning","ref":"fix-global-shadowing-warning","repo":{"id":1185629607,"node_id":"R_kgDORqtFpw","name":"godot","full_name":"acs110113/godot","owner":{"login":"acs110113","id":213753974,"node_id":"U_kgDODL2gdg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.g